                },
                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "54954770",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198057786313",
                            "num_reviews": 227,
                            "playtime_forever": 270,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 270,
                            "last_played": 1567552640
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I wish that this game would at least have one positive aspect that I could point out, so that I would have a reason to give it a positive review. Sadly, I couldn't identify a single positive feature in this game. Some achievements are bugged and there are some bugs in-game too. The voice acting is extremely annoying and terrible. The storyline isn't engaging at all. Most of the characters are really annoying and you can't possibly sympathise with them. There are no puzzles other than combining items and pipes. The characters move really slow and in an annoying way. The game doesn't have a proper ending, but it ends with an implication of an upcoming sequel (that we may never see). There are no choices other than deciding if the characters should be animals or humans, so I don't get what this \"choices matter\" tag is all about. Most of the tags have no reason to exist, to be honest. I should have refunded it when I had the chance, but I kept giving it more and more chances. Avoid buying it no matter the price, except if they decide to remake the whole game or something.",
